This strategy is as following : 
1. Get the stocks with future long build up or future short build up on previous day
2. get the Resitance and support for standard Pivot
3. Get 89 EMA  on 15 Minute candle 

Trage condition A : 
1. Check each of selected stock 
2. If any of that having long buildup  and is crossing above 89 High EMA  and crossing above R1 take a Bull Put Spread position
3. If any of that selected stock is having short buildup and is crossing below 89 Low EMA  and crossing Bewlow S1 take a Bull Put Spread position
4. Exit on +5% OR at 3:15 PM or when Support or resistance is broken other side


